    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "ちょ、聞いたんだけど！\r\n前のテスト、ガチで90いったわけ！？",
            "enText": "Hey, is it true? Did you really score\na ninety on the last test?!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -7488327891083765755,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "マジ意味わからんしっ！\r\n仕事もしてんのになんでぇー！？",
            "enText": "Are you a machine?! You work as a model\ntoo — when did you study?!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -8346408447534786924,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "まぁ、別に。\r\nロケバスの中でやってるし。",
            "enText": "I found time? Not like I'm doing anything\nin my trailer otherwise.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -3776637494341610802,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "なっる～。ロケバスがコツなんしょ？\r\nあたしも天才になれっかも☆",
            "enText": "I getcha… This super trailer is making you a\ngenius, right? C'mon, bestie, let me take it\nfor a spin☆",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 3803266873922288730,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "や、違うから。てかアンタ\r\nロケバス乗らんし、意味ないっしょ。",
            "enText": "Uh… it's just a trailer. Besides, trespassing\nwould get you in more trouble than any test.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 5477866213445202761,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "ガァーーン！　そぉじゃん！？",
            "enText": "Omigosh, facts!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 4214093580601683568,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "はー……で、どこわかんないの。\r\n追試なんでしょ。",
            "enText": "<i>Sigh…</i> You've got a make-up test, right?\nWhat parts didn't you understand?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -8781712920057954211,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "ウッソ、なんでバレたし……！？",
            "enText": "Whoa, how'd you know?!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -4981165896677653065,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トーセンジョーダン",
            "enName": "Tosen Jordan",
            "jpText": "てか教えてくれんの～！？\r\nヤッバー！",
            "enText": "Wait, you're seriously gonna help me?!\nNo way! Ahaha!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -7747488379276012144,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "ふふっ、はいはい。\r\nダテに友だち、やってませんからー。",
            "enText": "Hehe, why not. I'm not going to leave\nmy \"bestie\" hanging.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -3076125362429598247,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
